### Pluralization

| Key Path | English (one/other) | Arabic (zero/one/two/few/many/other) |
|----------|---------------------|--------------------------------------|
| `selection.elementsSelected` | (count: number) => count === 1 ? `${count} element selected` : `${count} elements selected` | (count: number) => zero: `${count} عنصر محدد`, one: `${count} عنصر محدد`, two: `عنصران محددان`, few: `${count} عناصر محددة`, many: `${count} عنصراً محدداً`, other: `${count} عنصر محدد` |
| `history.undoSteps` | (count: number) => count === 1 ? `${count} undo step` : `${count} undo steps` | (count: number) => one: `${count} خطوة تراجع`, few: `${count} خطوات تراجع`, many: `${count} خطوة تراجع`, other: `${count} خطوة تراجع` |

### Interpolation Parameters

| Key Path | Parameters | Types |
|----------|-----------|-------|
| `toolbar.zoomLevel` | `zoom: number` | number (zoom percentage, e.g. 75) |
| `notification.elementAdded` | `type: string` | string (element type label) |
| `notification.elementsCopied` | `count: number` | number (count of copied elements) |
| `notification.elementsPasted` | `count: number` | number (count of pasted elements) |
| `dialogs.confirmDelete` (many) | `count: number` | number (count of elements to delete) |
| `aria.elementLabel` | `type: string, x: number, y: number` | string + numbers |
| `aria.dragging` | `x: number, y: number` | numbers |
| `aria.resizing` | `w: number, h: number` | numbers |
| `aria.rotating` | `angle: number` | number (rotation degrees) |

### Implementation Location

- Type schema: `shared/locale/types/dashboard/certificates/canvas.ts`
- EN locale: `shared/locale/en/dashboard/certificates/canvas.ts`
- AR locale: `shared/locale/ar/dashboard/certificates/canvas.ts`
- Registration: in the existing dashboard certificates translation barrel (following Siraj's compile-time i18n pattern)
- Client components use `useAppTranslation(Translation.Dashboard.CertificatesCanvas)` from `@/shared/locale/client`
- Server components use `getTranslations(locale).dashboardTranslations.certificatesCanvas` from `@/shared/locale/server`
- GraphQL resolvers use `ctx.t(Translation.Dashboard.CertificatesCanvas)` from `@/shared/locale/server-graphql`

