## 6. Dependency Graph

```
Plan 5 (GraphQL API) ──────────────┐
Plan 10 (Template Editor Basic) ───┤
                                    ├─→ Plan 11 (Visual Canvas)
                                    │
Plan 1 (DB Schema) ─────────────────┤  (element table shape from Plan 1)
Plan 4 (Services) ──────────────────┘  (element bulk update service from Plan 4)
```

### Downstream Dependencies

- **Plan 12 (Element Management)** depends on Plan 11: element CRUD operations integrate with the canvas selection state and rendering
- **Plan 15 (Preview & Publishing)** depends on Plan 11: preview renders the canvas state to PDF; publishing snapshots element positions
